.TH advent 1 "FUZIX Games" "FUZIX"
.SH NAME
advent \- Colossal Cave
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B advent
.SH DESCRIPTION
The original adventure.  You are standing at the end of a road before a
small brick building.
.PP
Two-word commands:
.BR "GO NORTH" ,
.BR "TAKE LAMP" ,
.BR "KILL DWARF" .
.B HELP
explains itself,
.B QUIT
leaves, and
.B SAVE
keeps a game to come back to.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /usr/games/lib/advent.db
The text of the game, read as it is needed rather than held in memory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cowsay (1)
